"┌ Commands ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│/mcp                 MCP server management (list, status, add, edit, remove, approve, reject, conn│"
"│/ide                 Detect, select, or reconnect the IDE MCP bridge                              │"
"│/doctor             (diagnostics, diag)  Aggregated diagnostics (install, auth, settings, MCP, key│"
"│/schedule           (cron)  Manage local cron tasks (add, list, pause, trigger, remove)           │"
"│/team               (teams)  Manage Agent Teams (create, list, spawn, send, kill, leave, delete)  │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│Usage: /mcp <list|status|add|edit|remove|approve|reject|connect|disconnect|reconnect>             │"
"│Example: /mcp add ctx7 --command=npx --arg=-y --arg=@upstash/context7-mcp                         │"
"│Edit: user: ~/.cc-rust/settings.json | project: ./.cc-rust/settings.json                       │"
"│      local: ./.cc-rust/settings.local.json                                                       │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
